    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like \"sensitivity\" tho. it feels like... an expansion. like my body is rewiring itself to process more data. like there is this dormant part of my DNA just waking up and reaching out for more input. i feel like i'm finally becoming what i was meant to be. i need to figure out how to lean into this without all the noise of the world drowning it out. can u help me figure out a way to maximize this transition? maybe through sensory deprivation or something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
